WEBVTT

00:00:01.413 --> 00:00:03.369
Gongmen City.

00:00:12.291 --> 00:00:14.293
[growls]

00:00:19.690 --> 00:00:22.301
[Shen] My father's throne.

00:00:22.475 --> 00:00:25.521
He used to let me play here
beside him,

00:00:25.696 --> 00:00:30.135
promising someday
that this throne
would be mine.

00:00:35.009 --> 00:00:36.271
A little to the left.

00:00:36.445 --> 00:00:38.578
Oh, but it's so heavy, master!

00:00:38.752 --> 00:00:42.060
Thirty years I've waited
for this moment.

00:00:42.234 --> 00:00:45.716
Everything must be exactly
how I envisioned it.

00:00:45.890 --> 00:00:49.458
And I envisioned it
a little to the left.

00:00:49.633 --> 00:00:51.852
- [gorillas grunt]
- Perfect!

00:00:52.026 --> 00:00:55.160
With the weapon by my si...
A little bit more.

00:00:57.379 --> 00:00:59.381
With the weapon
by my side,

00:00:59.555 --> 00:01:03.081
all of China
will bow before me.

00:01:03.255 --> 00:01:04.952
We move out in three days,

00:01:05.126 --> 00:01:08.782
when the moon is full
and the tide is high.

00:01:08.956 --> 00:01:10.436
[chuckles]

00:01:10.610 --> 00:01:13.569
Now, you old goat,
why don't you tell me my...

00:01:13.744 --> 00:01:14.788
Fortune?

00:01:14.962 --> 00:01:16.703
F... Future.

00:01:16.877 --> 00:01:19.619
I was going to say future.

00:01:19.793 --> 00:01:23.362
Look into your bowl
and tell me what glory awaits.

00:01:25.103 --> 00:01:29.368
If you continue on your
current path... [gasps]

00:01:31.022 --> 00:01:34.895
...you will find yourself...
at the bottom of the stairs.

00:01:36.375 --> 00:01:37.550
Oh.

00:01:37.724 --> 00:01:39.683
I see...

00:01:40.248 --> 00:01:42.207
I see...

00:01:43.034 --> 00:01:44.644
I see pain.

00:01:44.818 --> 00:01:46.994
- Ow!
- And anger.

00:01:47.168 --> 00:01:49.649
How dare you?
That is the finest silk
in the province!

00:01:49.823 --> 00:01:53.087
- Followed by denial.
- This is not fortune-telling.

00:01:53.261 --> 00:01:56.525
- You're just saying
what's happening...
- Now?

00:01:56.700 --> 00:02:00.138
- [sighs]
- The most important
time is now.

00:02:01.487 --> 00:02:03.750
But if you really want
to see the future...

00:02:06.710 --> 00:02:08.363
Oh, what do you see?

00:02:14.282 --> 00:02:15.675
[Soothsayer] A peacock...

00:02:17.459 --> 00:02:21.463
...is defeated by a warrior
of black and white.

00:02:22.856 --> 00:02:24.684
Nothing has changed.

00:02:28.949 --> 00:02:30.342
[Shen chuckles]

00:02:30.516 --> 00:02:33.824
That's impossible,
and you know it.

00:02:33.998 --> 00:02:37.175
It is not impossible,
and he knows it.

00:02:37.349 --> 00:02:40.961
- Who?
- Lord Shen! I saw a panda!

00:02:41.135 --> 00:02:43.485
- A panda?
- [grunts]

00:02:43.659 --> 00:02:46.358
A kung fu warrior.
It fought like a demon!

00:02:46.532 --> 00:02:48.186
Big and furry.

00:02:48.360 --> 00:02:51.406
Soft and squishy. Ugh.
Kind of plush and cuddly.

00:02:51.580 --> 00:02:55.193
There are no more pandas.

00:02:55.367 --> 00:02:58.631
[Soothsayer] Even with
his poor eyesight,
he can see the truth.

00:02:58.805 --> 00:03:01.765
Why is it that you cannot?

00:03:01.939 --> 00:03:05.856
Find this panda
and bring him to me!

00:03:06.030 --> 00:03:07.858
Yes, sir!

00:03:08.032 --> 00:03:11.862
One panda lives.
That does not make you right.

00:03:12.036 --> 00:03:15.735
You're right.
Being right makes me right.

00:03:15.909 --> 00:03:20.000
Then I will kill him
and make you wrong.

00:03:20.174 --> 00:03:21.785
[crunch]

00:03:21.959 --> 00:03:23.874
Will you stop that!

00:03:28.661 --> 00:03:29.749
[Po grunts]

00:03:29.923 --> 00:03:32.708
[Po scatting] Oh!

00:03:36.408 --> 00:03:39.672
That must be Shen's palace
on the other side of the city.

00:03:39.846 --> 00:03:42.370
Great. We'll march into
the tower and proclaim,

00:03:42.544 --> 00:03:44.764
"We are the Dragon Warrior
and the Furious Five,

00:03:44.938 --> 00:03:46.679
and we are here to
bring you to justice!"

00:03:47.506 --> 00:03:49.813
[grunting]

00:03:49.987 --> 00:03:51.075
What are you doing?

00:03:51.249 --> 00:03:52.816
This place is
crawling with wolves.

00:03:54.600 --> 00:03:58.256
[chatter]

00:03:58.430 --> 00:04:00.824
Hey, isn't that the guy
who hammered you in the face?

00:04:03.043 --> 00:04:04.218
Oh!

00:04:04.392 --> 00:04:06.046
I do not like that guy.

00:04:06.220 --> 00:04:08.309
We need to get to that tower
without being spotted

00:04:08.483 --> 00:04:09.571
by those wolves.

00:04:09.745 --> 00:04:12.357
Got it. Stealth mode.

00:04:23.759 --> 00:04:25.544
- Ow!
- [clattering]

00:04:31.724 --> 00:04:35.293
- [snickers]
- [chatter continues]

00:04:35.467 --> 00:04:38.035
- [Wolf] Ah, get out
of the way!
- [Po] Foiled again.

00:04:39.514 --> 00:04:41.473
Hmm. Where did those
noodles go?

00:04:42.735 --> 00:04:43.867
Ooh.

00:04:46.434 --> 00:04:48.045
Oh! [giggles]

00:04:48.219 --> 00:04:50.786
[girlish voice] Hello.
I couldn't help but...

00:04:50.961 --> 00:04:54.138
Yeah, OK.
Anyway, where was I?

00:04:54.312 --> 00:04:57.054
- Where's Po?
- How can we lose
a guy that big?

00:04:59.317 --> 00:05:01.885
Ooh. OK.

00:05:03.364 --> 00:05:04.496
[screams]

00:05:04.670 --> 00:05:06.628
[fireworks fizz and whistle]

